values
  ('Welcome to Sahaba Club - Unleashing the Power of Technology Together!', 'welcome-to-sahaba-club-unleashing-the-power-of-technology-together-2023', 'Are you a technology passionate and eager to connect with like-minded individuals, learn from expert coaches, and achieve your goals in the world of technology? 

