Join us on August 2nd for a special webinar session, where we will warmly welcome all our early registrants and provide a comprehensive guide on how to make the most of your Sahaba Club membership & Microsoft 365 license.

Whether you''re an aspiring developer, a tech entrepreneur, or simply someone who loves to explore the wonders of technology, Sahaba Club is the perfect place for you. We believe that together, we can take technology and innovation to new heights!

Mark your calendars for August 2nd and embark on this exhilarating tech adventure with Sahaba Club.', '2023-08-02', '2023-08-02 20:30:00+04'::timestamptz, 90, 'Ahmed Abdel Razek', 'https://youtu.be/ntx9qAbYiYI?si=7S59xTxnRvoWHY2C', 'Online', null, 'Free', 'all', true),
  ('The Power of Code: High VS Low & No Code', 'the-power-of-code-high-vs-low-no-code-2023', 'Are you passionate about programming and eager to explore the latest technologies? 

