Our special guest, Wessam Combal, is a tech-savvy genius with hands-on experience, a creative vision, and an entrepreneurial mindset. 

Don''t miss the chance to learn from the best!

Discover the limitless possibilities of coding and unleash your creativity with high and low-code solutions! 

Join us for an eye-opening session!', '2023-08-09', '2023-08-09 20:30:00+04'::timestamptz, 90, 'Wessam Combal', 'https://youtu.be/FZ6B--Vm7BQ?si=gqRPjy9zkZsDkTRa', 'Online', null, 'Free', 'all', true),
  ('AI for Everyone: How to Build Your Skills and Career in the AI World', 'ai-for-everyone-how-to-build-your-skills-and-career-in-the-ai-world-2023', 'Are you curious about the world of Artificial Intelligence but don''t know where to start?

Join us for an engaging and informative webinar that will equip you with the essentials to kickstart your AI journey! 🚀🤖

🔍 Agenda:

Decoding Artificial Intelligence (AI) vs. Machine Learning (ML): What is the difference between AI and ML, and what are the main types and applications of both. 🤖🧠 

Launching Your AI Career: Discover the first steps and strategies to embark on a successful path in the field of AI.  🚀🔧

Unleashing AI on the Cloud: Explore the power of AI in the cloud computing 🌐 ☁️💡

You will have the opportunity to ask me any questions you have about AI and ML, and I will be happy to answer them. 😃', '2023-08-23', '2023-08-23 20:30:00+04'::timestamptz, 90, 'Ahmed Abdel Razek', 'https://youtu.be/e3J3z4u7zl0?si=n5vqeXq6aN1TPi4x', 'Online', null, 'Free', 'all', true),
  ('How to use Microsoft 365 to boost your tech skills with Sahaba Club', 'how-to-use-microsoft-365-to-boost-your-tech-skills-with-sahaba-club-2023', 'Agenda:

