Learn about the features and benefits of Microsoft 365 and how it can help you achieve your learning goals
Get your free Microsoft 365 license and start using its applications right away
Become a part of Sahaba Club and connect with other learners and coaches
Get your questions answered by the Sahaba Club team', '2023-08-30', '2023-08-30 20:30:00+04'::timestamptz, 90, 'Ahmed Abdel Razek', 'https://youtu.be/HM4HM95N7QU', 'Online', null, 'Free', 'all', true),
  ('Sahaba Club @ GosTech - IEEE BU', 'sahaba-club-gostech-ieee-bu-2023', 'مغامرتنا السنه دي مغامره من عالم تاني، و رفيقنا في المغامره دي هو Ghost
بس مش زي اللي في بالك 🤓
سنه 1983، كتاب سحري سحب صاحبنا الghost و حبسه في عالم تاني، و علشان يتحرر و يرجع لعالمنا الطبيعي، استعان بينا و احنا اللي هنساعده بنفس الكتاب اللي حبسه 🧐 و دا عن طريق اتباع إرشادات الكتاب لبناء عربيه بتتحكرك بإشارات الايد🖐🏻
و علي مدار 5 ايام في ايفنت ghostech هتتعلم انت كمان كل اللي محتاج تعرفه عن ال Arduino و Machine Learning و Computer Vision علشان تعرف ازاي تبني العربية🚘
و تابعوا معانا علشان تعرفوا ال ghost بتاعنا و ايه اللي خلاه يتحبس في العالم التاني و ازاي هيتحرر


"Our adventure this year is a journey from another world, and our companion in this escapade is GHOST. However, it''s not quite what you might have in mind. 🤓
In the year 1983, a magical book pulled our friend, the ghost, and imprisoned him in another world. To free him and bring him back to our normal world, he sought our help. We are the ones who will assist him using the same book that entrapped him. 🧐 This involves following the book''s instructions to construct a car that operates through hand signals. 🖐🏻
During the 5-day GHOSTECH event, you''ll also acquire all the necessary knowledge about Arduino, Machine Learning, and Computer Vision. This knowledge will enable you to build the car. 🚘
Join us to learn about our ghost, the reasons behind his imprisonment in the other world, and how he will achieve his freedom. 🤔', '2023-09-07', '2023-09-07 10:00:00+04'::timestamptz, 300, 'Ahmed Abdel Razek', 'https://youtu.be/HDUVb9o_v8s?si=ozUHxLmCfQA8tbNo', 'Online', null, 'Free', 'all', true),
  ('Microsoft Global Hackathon: Team Selection Workshop!', 'microsoft-global-hackathon-team-selection-workshop-2023', 'Build, innovate, and HackTogether! It''s time to get started building solutions with AI in the Power Platform!



HackTogether is your playground for experimenting with the new Copilot and AI features in the Power Platform. With mentorship from Microsoft experts and access to the latest tech, you will learn how to build solutions in Power Platform by leveraging AI. The possibilities are endless for what you can create... plus you can submit your hack for a chance to win exciting prizes! 🥳



The hackathon starts on September 14th - 28th. Registration will open up soon so check this page for more updates on how to register!', '2023-09-09', '2023-09-09 11:00:00+04'::timestamptz, 120, 'Mostafa Kotb', null, 'Online', null, 'Free', 'all', true),
